WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.537 --> 00:00:06.018
- [Evan] Ego is the enemy.

00:00:06.018 --> 00:00:08.215
"I don't like work, no man does,

00:00:08.215 --> 00:00:10.284
"but I like what is in the work,

00:00:10.284 --> 00:00:12.535
"the chance to find yourself."

00:00:12.535 --> 00:00:14.464
Joseph Conrad.

00:00:14.464 --> 00:00:16.431
For a full eight years, Winston Churchill

00:00:16.431 --> 00:00:18.687
stood more or less by himself

00:00:18.687 --> 00:00:20.515
against his shortsighted peers,

00:00:20.515 --> 00:00:24.477
against the rising threat of
fascism, even among the West.

00:00:24.477 --> 00:00:26.375
Welcome to the big show, folks.

00:00:26.375 --> 00:00:28.520
Sometimes that is what it takes.

00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:30.259
Sometimes we'll be forced to go it alone

00:00:30.259 --> 00:00:32.726
because we've alienated
everyone around us.

00:00:32.726 --> 00:00:35.376
Sometimes we'll be because
what we believe or do

00:00:35.376 --> 00:00:38.212
is so new that there's no other choice.

00:00:38.212 --> 00:00:40.609
Other times adverse will be environmental,

00:00:40.609 --> 00:00:43.393
accidental, or just temporary.

00:00:43.393 --> 00:00:44.779
There is no way around it.

00:00:44.779 --> 00:00:46.765
We will experience difficulty.

00:00:46.765 --> 00:00:49.244
We will feel the touch of failure.

00:00:49.244 --> 00:00:51.134
All of us exist in this continuum.

00:00:51.134 --> 00:00:52.971
We transition fluidly along it

00:00:52.971 --> 00:00:54.515
at various points in our lives.

00:00:54.515 --> 00:00:55.845
Perhaps we're born into privilege

00:00:55.845 --> 00:00:57.918
and then aspire to something greater.

00:00:57.918 --> 00:00:59.543
Perhaps we're born into great difficulty

00:00:59.543 --> 00:01:00.764
or start off on the wrong foot

00:01:00.764 --> 00:01:03.138
and then begin to pick up the pieces.

00:01:03.138 --> 00:01:05.385
Or more commonly, we set out in life

00:01:05.385 --> 00:01:07.895
hoping to do great
things, achieve success,

00:01:07.895 --> 00:01:09.712
undermine that success,

00:01:09.712 --> 00:01:12.252
and find ourselves
learning important lessons,

00:01:12.252 --> 00:01:15.189
as we seek to rebuild and recapture.

00:01:15.189 --> 00:01:18.701
But right now we're at
failure and it sucks.

00:01:18.701 --> 00:01:22.781
Whatever junction we're on
one thing dogs us - ego.

00:01:22.781 --> 00:01:24.625
It makes all the steps hard

00:01:24.625 --> 00:01:26.715
and it makes failure the hardest.

00:01:26.715 --> 00:01:28.996
It leads us to failure
and then abandons us.

00:01:28.996 --> 00:01:30.644
We're afraid to lose and fail

00:01:30.644 --> 00:01:33.016
because we think it
says something about us.

00:01:33.016 --> 00:01:34.166
It doesn't.

00:01:34.166 --> 00:01:35.545
Success didn't either.

00:01:35.545 --> 00:01:38.331
All the failure says is that
there was a chance to improve

00:01:38.331 --> 00:01:40.351
and better understand yourself.

00:01:40.351 --> 00:01:42.738
What we need to see is
that we are not failures,

00:01:42.738 --> 00:01:45.563
we're just experiencing failure.

00:01:45.563 --> 00:01:47.679
Where you're going next
or how long you'll be here

00:01:47.679 --> 00:01:49.158
no one can say.

00:01:49.158 --> 00:01:50.713
If ego accompanies you

00:01:50.713 --> 00:01:53.467
it will seek out failure like true north.

00:01:53.467 --> 00:01:55.607
It is its own worst enemy.

00:01:55.607 --> 00:01:57.621
It is your enemy.

00:01:57.621 --> 00:01:59.038
Ego is the enemy.

